{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52302","headline":"诗（幷序） 六十三 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 六十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无常元不避，[业]（叶）（项谓通「业」）到即须行。\n从（项校「徒」）作七尺影，俱坟一丈坑。\n妻儿啼哭送，鬼子唱歌迎。\n故来皆有死，何必得如（郭疑「长」）生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52302.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52302","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}